WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.337
Pieces of Her stars Toni
Collette and Bella Heathcote

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.255
as Laura and Andy Oliver,

00:00:05.339 --> 00:00:06.924
whose lives are changed
in the aftermath

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.258
of a violent attack.

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:11.303
Get down! Get down!

00:00:11.386 --> 00:00:13.847
It features so many twists
and time-jumps

00:00:13.931 --> 00:00:15.474
you might need help
untangling them.

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:16.475
I keep waiting

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:18.060
for something real
to come out of your mouth.

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:19.186
With that in mind,

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:21.313
we're going to dig
into Pieces of Her

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:22.689
and explain why
Laura and Andy

00:00:22.773 --> 00:00:24.650
have so many people
after them.

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:26.360
Final warning,

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:29.154
we're going to be discussing
spoilers so major,

00:00:29.238 --> 00:00:31.114
we might need to go
into hiding ourselves.

00:00:31.198 --> 00:00:33.575
Gotta go! You've gotta go.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:39.957
Before jumping to the end,

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.502
it's crucial to know exactly
who Laura Oliver is.

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:45.546
As revealed halfway
through the series,

00:00:45.629 --> 00:00:47.673
Laura's real name
is Jane Queller,

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:49.299
the daughter of
obscenely wealthy

00:00:49.383 --> 00:00:51.510
pharmaceutical head
Martin Queller,

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:53.887
and sister to Jasper
and Andrew.

00:00:53.971 --> 00:00:56.056
Through Andrew,
she meets Nick Harp,

00:00:56.139 --> 00:00:57.933
a charming radical
who runs a group

00:00:58.016 --> 00:01:00.018
called the Army
of the Changing World.

00:01:00.102 --> 00:01:02.354
As the pair's infatuation
grows stronger,

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:04.064
much to her father's
disapproval,

00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:06.024
Jane becomes active
in Nick's group,

00:01:06.108 --> 00:01:07.359
feeding him information

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:10.112
and helping out with
certain illicit activities.

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:12.573
If you see a car,

00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:14.116
flash this three times.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:17.452
Jane eventually becomes
pregnant with Nick's child,

00:01:17.536 --> 00:01:18.954
but decides not to tell him,

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:21.623
a decision with major
consequences for the pair.

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:23.709
And why didn't you tell me?

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:25.878
While keeping
her pregnancy quiet,

00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:28.255
they work on a plan
to embarrass her father

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:29.923
at a conference in Oslo.

00:01:30.007 --> 00:01:32.634
The scheme backfires
and Martin is shot on stage,

00:01:32.718 --> 00:01:33.844
which we'll
come back to later,

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:35.888
and Jane admits
her role in crimes

00:01:35.971 --> 00:01:37.806
in exchange
for witness protection.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:39.766
After serving time in jail,

00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:42.102
Jane and her young child,
Andy,

00:01:42.186 --> 00:01:44.271
who isn't aware of
her mother's true identity,

00:01:44.354 --> 00:01:46.440
go into hiding
in Belle Isle,

00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:48.734
-until the diner attack.
-Shoot me!

00:01:50.152 --> 00:01:52.613
Jane, now living under
witness protection as Laura,

00:01:52.696 --> 00:01:54.781
is concerned for her
and Andy's safety

00:01:54.865 --> 00:01:56.325
when the attack goes viral,

00:01:56.408 --> 00:01:57.618
and for good reason.

00:01:57.701 --> 00:01:59.161
This instant reveals
her whereabouts

00:01:59.244 --> 00:02:01.830
to her brother Jasper
and former lover Nick

00:02:01.914 --> 00:02:03.707
and forces Andy
to leave Belle Isle,

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.751
with her mother giving her
specific instructions

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:07.794
on where to go
and how to get there.

00:02:07.878 --> 00:02:10.589
Look, I will call you
as soon as it's safe.

00:02:10.672 --> 00:02:12.549
When you hear my voice,
you can come home,

00:02:12.633 --> 00:02:13.800
you understand?

00:02:18.096 --> 00:02:20.182
Andy's journey takes her
across the country

00:02:20.265 --> 00:02:22.643
and the occasional
trampoline park.

00:02:22.726 --> 00:02:26.396
As she pieces together
her mother's real identity,

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:29.274
a dramatic twist
late on in the show

00:02:29.358 --> 00:02:31.777
sees her kidnapped
by her real father, Nick.

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:33.987
Nick takes Andy to the cabin
where she was raised

00:02:34.071 --> 00:02:35.322
while Jane was in prison,

00:02:35.405 --> 00:02:36.657
convincing Jane
to head there

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:38.825
to be reunited
with her daughter.

00:02:38.909 --> 00:02:40.577
Nick uses this
as an opportunity

00:02:40.661 --> 00:02:43.622
to interrogate Jane about
her pregnancy with Andy.

00:02:43.705 --> 00:02:45.165
He's also trying
to find a tape

00:02:45.249 --> 00:02:46.834
that Jane has been
holding on to.

00:02:46.917 --> 00:02:48.919
I will explain the tape
in a moment too.

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:50.170
Where is it?

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:57.010
However, Andy attacks Nick

00:02:57.094 --> 00:02:58.262
and sets fire to the cabin.

00:02:58.345 --> 00:02:59.888
The tape Nick
was looking for,

00:02:59.972 --> 00:03:01.598
as well as the ransom money,

00:03:01.682 --> 00:03:04.393
are seemingly destroyed
while Nick tries to escape.

00:03:05.352 --> 00:03:07.729
Jane catches up to him,
ready to kill him.

00:03:08.313 --> 00:03:09.690
But Andy talks her down

00:03:09.773 --> 00:03:11.650
and the FBI arrive
to arrest him.

00:03:16.697 --> 00:03:19.116
Of course, to understand
why Nick was on the run,

00:03:19.199 --> 00:03:22.494
we need to explain Martin
Queller's murder in Oslo.

00:03:22.578 --> 00:03:24.246
Nick's group planned
to have Grace Juno

00:03:24.329 --> 00:03:25.539
infiltrate the panel

00:03:25.622 --> 00:03:27.624
by posing
as Professor Maplecroft

00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:30.752
and then embarrass Martin
by blowing up a dye bag.

00:03:30.836 --> 00:03:32.963
Grace was motivated
by losing her family

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:34.381
to one of QuellCorp's drugs.

00:03:35.007 --> 00:03:36.216
The plan was simple:

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:38.260
give her handbag
to Martin on stage

00:03:38.343 --> 00:03:41.221
where their non-lethal
explosive would go off.

00:03:41.305 --> 00:03:43.807
However, Jane spoke to Grace
before she snuck on stage,

00:03:43.891 --> 00:03:45.517
telling her that
she was pregnant

00:03:45.601 --> 00:03:47.060
and scared of what
her father might do

00:03:47.144 --> 00:03:48.729
to her unborn child.

00:03:49.563 --> 00:03:51.982
She then convinced Grace
to swap bags with her,

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:54.568
with Jane hiding a gun
in Grace's handbag.

00:03:55.235 --> 00:03:57.112
Grace then
fatally shoots Martin

00:03:57.196 --> 00:03:58.739
and kills herself.

00:04:03.535 --> 00:04:05.329
Back in America,
the group still have

00:04:05.412 --> 00:04:07.831
the real Professor
Maplecroft to deal with.

00:04:07.915 --> 00:04:08.916
They plan to let her go

00:04:08.999 --> 00:04:10.876
after Nick steals
her ransom money.

00:04:10.959 --> 00:04:12.878
When the professor tries to
escape from their hideout,

00:04:12.961 --> 00:04:15.339
she attacks Nick
and he kills her.

00:04:15.422 --> 00:04:17.090
As Nick kills Maplecroft,

00:04:17.174 --> 00:04:18.800
the FBI raid their hideout,

00:04:18.884 --> 00:04:21.970
forcing the gang to flee
to a remote cabin.

00:04:22.054 --> 00:04:23.847
It's here where
tensions boil over

00:04:23.931 --> 00:04:26.391
as the group discover Andrew
was shot in their escape

00:04:26.475 --> 00:04:27.976
and are divided
on what to do.

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:28.936
What are you doing?

00:04:29.019 --> 00:04:31.355
I'm taking Andrew
to the hospital.

00:04:31.438 --> 00:04:34.024
Jane, who is in the early
stages of her pregnancy,

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:35.943
begs Nick to take Andrew
to a hospital,

00:04:36.026 --> 00:04:37.736
but he violently refuses,

00:04:37.819 --> 00:04:39.446
which convinces Jane
to leave him.

00:04:39.947 --> 00:04:41.740
She smuggles Andrew
to a hospital,

00:04:41.823 --> 00:04:42.824
but it is too late.

00:04:43.408 --> 00:04:45.035
While her brother Jasper
joins her

00:04:45.118 --> 00:04:47.454
to try and plot a way out
of this situation for Jane,

00:04:47.538 --> 00:04:49.998
-she tells him…
-I know all about Oslo.

00:04:50.749 --> 00:04:52.084
What?

00:04:52.167 --> 00:04:53.919
Don't worry,
we can explain that.

00:04:57.923 --> 00:05:00.300
But what about Jasper
Queller's role in all this?

00:05:00.384 --> 00:05:01.760
Jane's brother
is an aspiring

00:05:01.844 --> 00:05:03.637
vice-presidential candidate.

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:04.930
And when Andy
tracks him down

00:05:05.013 --> 00:05:07.349
after discovering
her mum's true identity,

00:05:07.432 --> 00:05:08.892
he initially seems
to be willing to help her

00:05:08.976 --> 00:05:11.311
out of the kindness
of his heart.

00:05:11.395 --> 00:05:13.814
His true motivations
are murkier.

00:05:13.897 --> 00:05:15.774
That tape Nick wanted
in the cabin?

00:05:15.858 --> 00:05:17.025
Well, it showed
Jasper and Nick

00:05:17.109 --> 00:05:18.485
working together
on the Oslo plan,

00:05:18.569 --> 00:05:22.281
with Jasper conspiring
to become CEO of QuellCorp.

00:05:22.364 --> 00:05:24.408
Jasper gets his wish
of running the company.

00:05:24.491 --> 00:05:25.701
But knowing
that Jane has the tape

00:05:25.784 --> 00:05:27.870
that could potentially
destroy his reputation,

00:05:27.953 --> 00:05:30.706
means he's keen
to ensure her silence.

00:05:30.789 --> 00:05:32.291
When they meet
after Nick's arrest,

00:05:32.374 --> 00:05:33.667
Jane tries
to convince Jasper

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.211
he should find out what
Nick has told investigators,

00:05:36.295 --> 00:05:37.921
and he admonishes her
for it.

00:05:38.005 --> 00:05:39.381
Jane also reveals to him

00:05:39.464 --> 00:05:42.176
that the tape was destroyed
in the cabin fire.

00:05:42.259 --> 00:05:43.218
You don't believe me?

00:05:43.302 --> 00:05:45.012
However,
when a listening device

00:05:45.095 --> 00:05:46.263
planted on Andy's phone

00:05:46.346 --> 00:05:48.307
reveals to one
of Jasper's employees

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:50.017
that Jane was the one
who instigated

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:51.101
her father's death,

00:05:51.185 --> 00:05:54.021
it gives Jasper the leverage
he craves over his sister,

00:05:54.104 --> 00:05:55.772
ringing her
to flaunt his knowledge

00:05:55.856 --> 00:05:56.982
and blackmail her.

00:05:57.065 --> 00:05:59.735
This call introduces
a major cliff-hanger,

00:05:59.818 --> 00:06:01.987
with Jasper now holding
information over Jane

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:03.947
that he'll seemingly
want to cash in.

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:06.283
With Nick's fate
still up in the air,

00:06:06.366 --> 00:06:08.452
Jane and Andy
might not yet have escaped

00:06:08.535 --> 00:06:10.871
the web of corruption
they're trapped in.

00:06:10.954 --> 00:06:12.873
Of course, we want to hear
your theories

00:06:12.956 --> 00:06:14.416
on what happened
in Pieces of Her

00:06:14.499 --> 00:06:15.417
in the comments.

00:06:15.501 --> 00:06:16.668
And if you want
to keep up to date

00:06:16.752 --> 00:06:19.046
with the stories behind your
favourite Netflix shows,

00:06:19.129 --> 00:06:22.257
be sure to subscribe
to Still Watching Netflix.

